# Mouse, keyboard and wheel on buttons.wisp (11-Q1, D3). The bar's
# buttons: Save at x 8..98, Cancel at x 106..196, Delete at x 204..294.
listen pointerdown click focusin keydown keyup wheel scroll
click 50 24                   Save by mouse
expect event pointerdown button#save
expect event click button#save
expect focus button#save
key Tab                       to Cancel; Tab shows the ring
expect focus-visible button#cancel
key Enter                     Enter activates on keydown
expect event click button#cancel
key Space                     Space activates on keyup
expect event click button#cancel
click 250 24                  Delete is disabled: no click, and focus leaves Cancel
expect no event click
expect focus body
wheel 100 90 0 40             the list scrolls
expect event wheel div#list>div:nth-child(3)
expect event scroll div#list
